{
  // PvE-specific corrections.
  //
  // EMPTY (1.1.0.0 unification): the Season 1 patch notes state the task
  // reward rebalance applies to ALL game modes (PvP Season, PvP Zone, PvE
  // Zone), the 1.1-pve data carries single mode-free values for every reward
  // and condition (gameMode filters are edition gates only, never
  // regular/pve/pvp-season), and the wiki is simply lagging on the affected
  // pages. The 12 corrections that previously lived here (10 quest XP
  // reworks, Collector minPlayerLevel, Long Road kill count) therefore apply
  // to every mode and were MOVED to the base overrides
  // (src/overrides/tasks.json5); the divergence registry
  // (src/divergences/tasks.json5) was converged to match.
  //
  // tarkov.dev still serves the stale pre-1.1 values in all three modes, so
  // the base overrides remain load-bearing everywhere; `npm run
  // check-overrides` verifies this per mode. Any genuinely PvE-only
  // correction (upstream wrong in PvE but correct elsewhere) should be added
  // back to this file; the removed entries are recoverable from git history.
}
